"P526088057" "To prove your strength, you must face the obstacles that this cursed city has created for you. They will hone your abilities and make you stronger than ever. I shall know when you have completed them, whether it be in your present time, or through the use of time travel. Shall we begin?<br><br><color orange>You can begin progress on completing Gabriel's mission before accepting it. Gabriel will observe if you have done these tasks already when you speak with him again.</color>"
